{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_455ce84eac954428abbe02b2","type":"tool_result","content":"     1→# Ralph Progress Log\n     2→\n     3→This file tracks progress across iterations. Agents update this file\n     4→after each iteration and it's included in prompts for context.\n     5→\n     6→## Codebase Patterns (Study These First)\n     7→\n     8→*Add reusable patterns discovered during development here.*\n     9→\n    10→---\n    11→\n    12→## 2025-02-08 - US-060\n    13→- Created complete website for Dra Thamyres Branco - Harmonização Facial em Ribeirão Preto\n    14→- Files changed:\n    15→  - `site-demo/dra-thamyres-branco-harmonizacao-facial/index.html` (new)\n    16→- **Design Concept**: Amethyst Noir & Platinum aesthetic with deep amethyst purples, cool platinum silver accents, and white marble backgrounds. A completely new mystical direction from previous palettes (rose/gold, sage/pearl, lavender/mocha, emerald/silk, rose/quartz, amber/bronze, plum/gold, sapphire/champagne, pearl/mink, opal/dusty rose, coral/seafoam, burgundy/gold). Geode/crystal shard-shaped border-radius patterns create crystalline, mystical animations reminiscent of amethyst geodes.\n    17→- **Typography**: Playfair Display (display) paired with Space Grotesk (body) for elegant sophistication with modern geometric character\n    18→- **Key Features Implemented**:\n    19→  - Animated hero with 4 floating geode/crystal shard backgrounds using gradient meshes\n    20→  - Geode/crystal shard border-radius patterns (`--radius-geode-1`, `--radius-geode-2`, `--radius-geode-3`, `--radius-geode-4`) create crystalline, mystical animations\n    21→  - Auto-hiding navigation with smooth scroll\n    22→  - Problem/Solution section with hover effects and left border accent\n    23→  - 6 service cards (Harmonização Facial, Toxina Botulínica, Preenchedores Faciais, Preenchimento Labial, Bioestimuladores, Protocolos Exclusivos)\n    24→  - 3 testimonial cards with gradient avatars on amethyst-mystic background\n    25→  - 6 differential items with pulsing icon rings\n    26→  - Contact form with WhatsApp integration (opens pre-filled message)\n    27→  - Responsive design for mobile, tablet, desktop\n    28→  - Intersection Observer animations for scroll-triggered effects\n    29→  - Accessibility: prefers-reduced-motion support, focus styles, semantic HTML\n    30→- **Contact Info**: R. João Penteado, 1545 - Jardim America, Ribeirão Preto - SP, 14020-180 | (16) 99240-4658\n    31→- **Demo URL**: pixelalchemy.com.br/site-demo/dra-thamyres-branco-harmonizacao-facial\n    32→- **Verification**:\n    33→  - Desktop view verified: ✓\n    34→  - Mobile view (375x812) responsive: ✓\n    35→  - Form submission to WhatsApp: ✓\n    36→  - Smooth scroll navigation: ✓\n    37→  - All sections present: Hero, Problema/Solução, Serviços, Depoimentos, Diferenciais, Contato, Footer: ✓\n    38→\n    39→**Learnings:**\n    40→- **Pattern**: Amethyst Noir & Platinum palette creates a mystical, sophisticated aesthetic with cool crystalline qualities that conveys transformation and premium elegance - completely different from all previous palettes\n    41→- **Pattern**: Geode/crystal shard border-radius shapes (`72% 28% 48% 52% / 52% 38% 62% 48%`) provide a more crystalline, geometric interpretation of blobmorphism with sharp angular qualities that feel mystical and architectural\n    42→- **Pattern**: Playfair Display + Space Grotesk typography pairing combines elegant serif display with modern geometric sans-serif for sophisticated readability\n    43→- **Gotcha**: The amethyst-platinum-marble palette feels more mystical and contemporary while maintaining premium positioning - it evokes feelings of transformation, mystery, and modern elegance\n    44→- **Gotcha**: Geode/crystal shard-shaped borders create a distinctive crystalline aesthetic with sharp angular movements that feel alive and dynamic - different from all previous shape patterns used\n    45→- **Gotcha**: Marble backgrounds (#FAFAFC) provide cool clean foundation without being as yellow-based as cream tones, creating a cleaner, more modern foundation\n    46→- **Gotcha**: The cool amethyst palette differentiates significantly from the warm palettes of previous sites while maintaining the premium aesthetic expected by aesthetic clinic clients\n    47→- **Performance**: All animations use GPU-accelerated properties (transform, opacity) for smooth 60fps performance\n    48→- **Mobile optimization**: Enhanced hover states disabled on touch devices, stacked layouts for smaller screens, floating cards hidden on mobile\n    49→\n    50→**Codebase Patterns Added**:\n    51→- **Amethyst Noir & Platinum Palette**: `--color-amethyst: #6B3A82`, `--color-amethyst-light: #8B4A9E`, `--color-amethyst-dark: #4B2A62`, `--color-amethyst-deep: #2B1A42`, `--color-amethyst-mystic: #1A0E28`, `--color-platinum: #C8C8D0`, `--color-platinum-light: #D8D8E0`, `--color-platinum-dark: #A8A8B0`, `--color-platinum-shimmer: #E8E8F0`, `--color-marble: #FAFAFC`, `--color-marble-warm: #F5F5F8` - mystical, sophisticated crystalline aesthetic perfect for modern aesthetic clinics\n    52→- **Geode Crystal Border Radius**: `--radius-geode-1: 72% 28% 48% 52% / 52% 38% 62% 48%`, `--radius-geode-2: 48% 52% 68% 32% / 38% 62% 38% 62%`, `--radius-geode-3: 62% 38% 42% 58% / 58% 42% 52% 48%`, `--radius-geode-4: 38% 62% 52% 48% / 42% 58% 48% 52%` for crystalline, geometric shapes with sharp angular qualities\n    53→- **Playfair Display + Space Grotesk Typography**: Elegant serif display font paired with modern geometric sans-serif body font for sophisticated elegance with excellent readability\n    54→\n    55→---\n    56→\n    57→## 2024-02-08 - US-048\n    58→- Created complete website for Dra. Angélica Lucena - Harmonização Facial em Ribeirão Preto\n    59→- Files changed:\n    60→  - `site-demo/dra-angelica-lucena/index.html` (new)\n    61→- **Design Concept**: Ethereal/Luminous aes